### Identity API — requisicoes rapidas para o VS Code / Rider / Visual Studio.
### Rode de cima para baixo: as variaveis sao encadeadas.

@host = http://localhost:5100

### 1. Cadastrar usuario
# @name cadastrar
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bruno Demo",
  "email": "bruno.demo@teste.com",
  "password": "senha-forte-123"
}

### Captura os dados da resposta anterior.
@accessToken = {{cadastrar.response.body.accessToken}}
@refreshToken = {{cadastrar.response.body.refreshToken}}
@userId = {{cadastrar.response.body.userId}}

### 2. Cadastro duplicado -> 409 (mesmo e-mail com caixa diferente)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Outro",
  "email": "BRUNO.DEMO@Teste.com",
  "password": "outra-senha-123"
}

### 3. Cadastro invalido -> 400 com a lista de campos (RFC 9457)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "nao-e-email",
  "password": "123"
}

### 4. Login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bruno.demo@teste.com",
  "password": "senha-forte-123"
}

### 5. Login com senha errada -> 401 (mensagem identica a de usuario inexistente)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bruno.demo@teste.com",
  "password": "senha-errada"
}

### 6. Renovar tokens (rotacao: o token antigo e revogado)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 7. Meu perfil (o id vem do token, nao da URL)
GET {{host}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 8. Cadastrar endereco
POST {{host}}/api/users/{{userId}}/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "street": "Rua das Flores",
  "number": "123",
  "city": "Sao Paulo",
  "state": "SP",
  "zipCode": "01234-567",
  "country": "Brasil"
}

### 9. Perfil de outro usuario -> 403 (protecao contra IDOR)
GET {{host}}/api/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 10. Sem token -> 401
GET {{host}}/api/users/me

### Saude
GET {{host}}/health/ready
